<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Visualizations of how our ReCOT works. The object-relevant tokens progressively focus and strengthen around the indicated object, while object-irrelevant tokens weaken and stabilize to background patterns.</figcaption>
</figure>
